<title>UK: LME copper adds to gains in evening session.</title>
<headline>LME copper adds to gains in evening session.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Metal Exchange (LME) copper prices edged slightly firmer by 1900 GMT on Wednesday from a positive kerb close.</p>
<p>However traders said the volumes were light and the market remained featureless.</p>
<p>Copper was indicated at $2,268, $6 ahead of the kerb which had showed a gain of $7 from Tuesday.</p>
<p>Aluminium had added $12 during the day's business on trade buying and held the gain during the evening session.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 8058</p>
